; ==========================================
; First Steps in Samoan / Gagana Sāmoa (sm)
; MultiLang-ASM Kids
; ==========================================

sui box 10       ; Put 10 candies in the box
faaopoopo box 5        ; Get 5 more candies (15)
toese box 2        ; Eat 2 candies (13 left!)
valaau_faiga box         ; Show the final candy count!
